    "Projectile speed: AE lets a player reach 166% movement (playerRunSpeedCapMax in records\\game\\gameengine.dbr) while projectile velocities stayed at their 2006 values, so every cast trails the pace of the fight. set_player_projectile_speed 66 restores that ratio for player-side skills only.",
